.SH "نام (NAME)"
kmag \- Screen magnifier
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBkmag\fR\ 'u
\fBkmag\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBkmag\fR, also known as
KMagnifier
is a screen magnifier\&. You can use
KMagnifier
to magnify a part of the screen just as you would use a lens to magnify a newspaper fine\-print or a photograph\&. This application is useful for a variety of people: from researchers to artists to web\-designers to people with low vision\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.RS 4
More detailed user documentation is available from \m[blue]\fBhelp:/kmag\fR\m[]
(either enter this URL into Konqueror, or run
\fB\fBkhelpcenter\fR\fR\fB
\fR\fB\fIhelp:/kmag\fR\fR)\&.
.RE
.RS 4
kf6options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
qt6options(7)
.RE
.RS 4
There is also further information available at \m[blue]\fBthe KDE accessibility project home page\&.\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[1]\d\s+2
.RE
